You draw power from the depths of the void causing your Reality Fracture to enhance any existing rifts.

Void Rift: Deals [20%, 46%, 67%, 84%, 100% (TL1-5)] increased damage and projectiles explode in radius 1.

Nether Breach: Deals [20%, 46%, 67%, 84%, 100% (TL1-5)] increased damage and chains to 3 targets.

Temporal Vortex: Deals [20%, 46%, 67%, 84%, 100% (TL1-5)] increased damage, radius increased by 1, and slow increased to 50%.

Dimensional Gate: Voidling Skitterers will be frenzied, increasing their global speed by [20%, 46%, 67%, 84%, 100% (TL1-5)].
